(
    title: "Pacar",
    description: Some("Clear every dot from a set of three-dimensional routes while an enemy car obstructs the same course. A held button gives a burst of speed and reversing halves your pace; the thirtieth dot cleared, and every thirtieth after, becomes a special one that turns your car invincible and able to ram the enemy. A red car latches on behind until you slip through the warp roads at either edge."),
